<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for the period Feb 23-March 2 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>	     Feb 23-Mar 2  Feb 26-Mar 3   TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		  1996/97     1995/96	1996/97	1995/96</p>
<p> Stocks/open    444,467.3   512,190.8</p>
<p> Production	 1,446.7	   0     1,089,679.4    973,306.9</p>
<p> Shipment	   8,941.8    42,512.0     811,052.6    644,865.5</p>
<p> Home Market	  333.3	 254.3	11,435.7     13,067.0</p>
<p> Stocks/close   436,638.9   469,424.5</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
